            <li>Myung SK, Park Y. Effects of Collagen Supplements on Skin Aging. American Journal of Medicine, 2025.</li>
            <li>Dolečková I et al. Oral sodium hyaluronate improves skin hydration, barrier function and signs of aging. Scientific Reports, 2025.</li>
